{"id":"a4b9fabe5e4a10db","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FEncodeTermRow.md","title":"FEncodeTermRow","display":"FEncodeTermRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FEncodeTermRow","parameters":["F","f","z4871","z4872","z4873"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FEncodeTermRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>F</span><span>f</span><span>z4871</span><span>z4872</span><span>z4873</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶 alpha 编码。有序参数：<code>F</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>z4871</code>、<code>z4872</code>、<code>z4873</code>。</p>\n<p>变量栈最近绑定优先；外部自由名编码为栈长加名字。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FEncodeTermRow F f z4871 z4872 z4873)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists g\n  (exists t\n    (exists u\n      (and\n        (exists z4876 (and (@ Pair t u z4876) (@ Pair g z4876 z4873)))\n        (and\n          (@ FTerm F f t)\n          (and\n            (exists w (exists l (and (@ Omega w) (@ SeqTo g l w))))\n            (or\n              (exists z4877\n                (exists z4878\n                  (exists z4879\n                    (and\n                      (@ FVar z4877 t)\n                      (and\n                        (@ Seq g z4879)\n                        (and\n                          (or\n                            (@ NFirst g z4877 z4878)\n                            (and (not (exists z4884 (@ NFirst g z4877 z4884))) (@ Add z4879 z4877 z4878)))\n                          (@ FVar z4878 u)))))))\n              (exists z4880\n                (exists z4881\n                  (exists z4882\n                    (exists z4883\n                      (and\n                        (@ FFun z4880 z4881 t)\n                        (and\n                          (@ FFun z4880 z4882 u)\n                          (and\n                            (@ Seq z4881 z4883)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Seq z4882 z4883)\n                            (forall z4884\n                            (implies\n                            (in z4884 z4883)\n                            (exists z4885\n                            (exists z4886\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z4881 z4884 z4885)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z4882 z4884 z4886)\n                            (exists z4887\n                            (exists z4888\n                            (and\n                            (in z4887 z4872)\n                            (and (@ App z4871 z4887 z4888) (exists z4889 (and (@ Pair z4885 z4886 z4889) (@ Pair g z4889 z4888))))))))))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fe9bf6b2a1b03aa\" href=\"?note=0fe9bf6b2a1b03aa\" title=\"ZFC_Add\">Add</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140c6359fed2eb8a\" href=\"?note=140c6359fed2eb8a\" title=\"ZFC_FFun\">FFun</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"21487f65c94a2183\" href=\"?note=21487f65c94a2183\" title=\"ZFC_FTerm\">FTerm</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e67edc6c28bf5962\" href=\"?note=e67edc6c28bf5962\" title=\"ZFC_FVar\">FVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0a6fdefd03771be4\" href=\"?note=0a6fdefd03771be4\" title=\"ZFC_NFirst\">NFirst</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"572634b8affcd095\" href=\"?note=572634b8affcd095\" title=\"ZFC_SeqTo\">SeqTo</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FEncodeTermRow F f z4871 z4872 z4873)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Add","status":"resolved","id":"0fe9bf6b2a1b03aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Add|Add]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FFun|FFun]]；[[ZFC_FTerm|FTerm]]；[[ZFC_FVar|FVar]]；[[ZFC_NFirst|NFirst]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_SeqTo|SeqTo]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Add|Add]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FFun|FFun]]；[[ZFC_FTerm|FTerm]]；[[ZFC_FVar|FVar]]；[[ZFC_NFirst|NFirst]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_SeqTo|SeqTo]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FFun","status":"resolved","id":"140c6359fed2eb8a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Add|Add]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_